{"seq":3,"slug":"accessibility-reduced-motion","title":"无障碍与动效偏好：prefers-reduced-motion 与前庭障碍保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/performance/accessibility-reduced-motion","wordCount":950,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"无障碍与动效偏好-prefers-reduced-motion-与前庭障碍保护\">无障碍与动效偏好：prefers-reduced-motion 与前庭障碍保护</h1><p>动画是 Web 体验的增强，但对于部分用户而言，动画可能造成真实的身体伤害。前庭障碍（vestibular disorders）患者会因为屏幕上的运动、闪烁或视差效果产生恶心、眩晕甚至头痛。<code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> 媒体查询是操作系统层面提供的动效偏好接口，工程师有责任尊重这个设置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前庭障碍与动画危险性\">前庭障碍与动画危险性</h2><p><strong>前庭系统</strong>负责人体的空间定向和平衡感。前庭障碍包括梅尼埃病、良性阵发性位置性眩晕（BPPV）、内耳炎等。据统计，约 35% 的 40 岁以上成年人有不同程度的前庭功能障碍。</p>\n<p><strong>对前庭障碍用户危险的动画类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>危险级别</th>\n<th>动画类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高危</td>\n<td>视差滚动</td>\n<td>前景/背景移动速度不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高危</td>\n<td>大范围平移</td>\n<td>覆盖大部分屏幕的横向/纵向移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高危</td>\n<td>缩放/旋转</td>\n<td>整页或大元素的缩放和旋转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中危</td>\n<td>自动播放的动画</td>\n<td>用户无法控制的持续运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中危</td>\n<td>闪烁效果</td>\n<td>频率 &gt;3Hz 可能触发光敏性癫痫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低危</td>\n<td>透明度渐变</td>\n<td>纯 opacity 变化通常安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>位移 &lt;5px</td>\n<td>微小的位移感知不强烈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"prefers-reduced-motion-媒体查询\">prefers-reduced-motion 媒体查询</h2><p>macOS、iOS、Windows 和 Android 均提供了「减少动画」或「减少动效」系统设置，浏览器通过 <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> 媒体查询暴露这个偏好：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 默认：正常动画 */&#10;.animated-element {&#10;  transition:&#10;    transform 0.4s ease,&#10;    opacity 0.3s ease;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 尊重减少动画偏好 */&#10;@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {&#10;  .animated-element {&#10;    /* 策略 1：完全禁用动画 */&#10;    transition: none;&#10;    animation: none;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  /* 策略 2：仅保留透明度（安全的动画） */&#10;  .important-feedback {&#10;    transition: opacity 0.2s ease; /* 只用 opacity，不用位移/缩放 */&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  /* 策略 3：大幅缩短时长 */&#10;  .subtle-animation {&#10;    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 默认：正常动画 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.animated-element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transform </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    opacity </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 尊重减少动画偏好 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .animated-element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 策略 1：完全禁用动画 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 策略 2：仅保留透明度（安全的动画） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .important-feedback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: opacity </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 只用 opacity，不用位移/缩放 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 策略 3：大幅缩短时长 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .subtle-animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transition-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-iteration-count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"全局重置策略\">全局重置策略</h3><p>一种强健的全局策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 推荐的全局无障碍动画重置 */&#10;@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce), (update: slow) {&#10;  /* update: slow 针对低刷新率设备（如 e-ink 屏幕） */&#10;  *,&#10;  *::before,&#10;  *::after {&#10;    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;&#10;    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;&#10;    scroll-behavior: auto !important;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 推荐的全局无障碍动画重置 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce), (update: slow) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* update: slow 针对低刷新率设备（如 e-ink 屏幕） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    animation-iteration-count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transition-duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    scroll-behavior</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !important</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：这里使用 <code>0.01ms</code> 而不是 <code>0ms</code>，原因是某些浏览器在动画时长为 0 时不会触发 <code>animationend</code> 事件，可能导致依赖此事件的逻辑失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"javascript-中检测-reduced-motion\">JavaScript 中检测 reduced-motion</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 检测当前偏好&#10;const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(&#39;(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)&#39;).matches;&#10;&#10;// 监听偏好变化（用户在运行时更改系统设置）&#10;const mediaQuery = window.matchMedia(&#39;(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)&#39;);&#10;mediaQuery.addEventListener(&#39;change&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.matches) {&#10;    // 用户开启了减少动画&#10;    pauseAllAnimations();&#10;  } else {&#10;    // 用户关闭了减少动画&#10;    resumeAnimations();&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检测当前偏好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prefersReducedMotion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).matches;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 监听偏好变化（用户在运行时更改系统设置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mediaQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mediaQuery.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event.matches) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 用户开启了减少动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    pauseAllAnimations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 用户关闭了减少动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    resumeAnimations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"react-hook-封装\">React Hook 封装</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useState, useEffect } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function usePrefersReducedMotion(): boolean {&#10;  const [prefersReducedMotion, setPrefersReducedMotion] = useState(&#10;    () =&gt; window.matchMedia(&#39;(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)&#39;).matches,&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const mediaQuery = window.matchMedia(&#39;(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)&#39;);&#10;&#10;    const handleChange = (event: MediaQueryListEvent) =&gt; {&#10;      setPrefersReducedMotion(event.matches);&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    mediaQuery.addEventListener(&#39;change&#39;, handleChange);&#10;    return () =&gt; mediaQuery.removeEventListener(&#39;change&#39;, handleChange);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return prefersReducedMotion;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用&#10;function AnimatedHero() {&#10;  const prefersReducedMotion = usePrefersReducedMotion();&#10;&#10;  const transition = prefersReducedMotion ? { duration: 0 } : { duration: 0.6, ease: &#39;easeOut&#39; };&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;motion.div&#10;      initial={{ opacity: 0, y: prefersReducedMotion ? 0 : 30 }}&#10;      animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}&#10;      transition={transition}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      内容&#10;    &lt;/motion.div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function usePrefersReducedMotion(): boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [prefersReducedMotion, setPrefersReducedMotion] = useState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const mediaQuery = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const handleChange = (event: MediaQueryListEvent) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setPrefersReducedMotion(event.matches);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mediaQuery.addEventListener('change', handleChange);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => mediaQuery.removeEventListener('change', handleChange);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return prefersReducedMotion;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function AnimatedHero() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const prefersReducedMotion = usePrefersReducedMotion();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const transition = prefersReducedMotion ? { duration: 0 } : { duration: 0.6, ease: 'easeOut' };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;motion.div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      initial={{ opacity: 0, y: prefersReducedMotion ? 0 : 30 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transition={transition}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/motion.div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"动画时长上限规范\">动画时长上限规范</h2><p>WCAG 2.1 成功标准 2.2.2（AAA）要求所有自动移动、滚动或闪烁的内容可以被用户暂停、停止或隐藏（当持续时间超过 5 秒时）。工程实践中的时长建议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动画类型</th>\n<th>推荐时长上限</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>微交互（hover/click 反馈）</td>\n<td>≤ 200ms</td>\n<td>响应应即时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元素入场动画</td>\n<td>≤ 600ms</td>\n<td>超出显得拖沓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页面过渡</td>\n<td>≤ 400ms</td>\n<td>等待感明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂序列动画</td>\n<td>≤ 2000ms</td>\n<td>需提供跳过选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动循环动画</td>\n<td>提供暂停按钮</td>\n<td>超过 5s 必须可控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"动画开关-用户控制界面\">动画开关：用户控制界面</h2><p>除了系统偏好，应用级别也应提供动画开关：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function AnimationToggle() {&#10;  const [animationsEnabled, setAnimationsEnabled] = useState(true)&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    // 将状态同步到 CSS 自定义属性&#10;    document.documentElement.style.setProperty(&#10;      &#39;--animation-duration-scale&#39;,&#10;      animationsEnabled ? &#39;1&#39; : &#39;0.001&#39;&#10;    )&#10;  }, [animationsEnabled])&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;button&#10;      onClick={() =&gt; setAnimationsEnabled(prev =&gt; !prev)}&#10;      aria-label={animationsEnabled ? &#39;关闭动画&#39; : &#39;开启动画&#39;}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      {animationsEnabled ? &#39;关闭动画&#39; : &#39;开启动画&#39;}&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* CSS 中使用缩放变量 */&#10;.animated-element {&#10;  transition-duration: calc(0.4s * var(--animation-duration-scale, 1));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function AnimationToggle() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [animationsEnabled, setAnimationsEnabled] = useState(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 将状态同步到 CSS 自定义属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    document.documentElement.style.setProperty(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      '--animation-duration-scale',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      animationsEnabled ? '1' : '0.001'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [animationsEnabled])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onClick={() => setAnimationsEnabled(prev => !prev)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      aria-label={animationsEnabled ? '关闭动画' : '开启动画'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {animationsEnabled ? '关闭动画' : '开启动画'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/* CSS 中使用缩放变量 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.animated-element {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  transition-duration: calc(0.4s * var(--animation-duration-scale, 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"gsap-中的全局动效偏好处理\">GSAP 中的全局动效偏好处理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { gsap } from &#39;gsap&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 在应用初始化时检测并配置&#10;const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(&#39;(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)&#39;).matches;&#10;&#10;if (prefersReducedMotion) {&#10;  // 全局 GSAP 加速：所有动画压缩到极短时间&#10;  gsap.globalTimeline.timeScale(100);&#10;&#10;  // 或者禁用特定类型的动画&#10;  // ScrollTrigger 保留（位置触发不涉及运动），但动画时长压缩&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { gsap } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gsap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在应用初始化时检测并配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prefersReducedMotion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).matches;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prefersReducedMotion) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 全局 GSAP 加速：所有动画压缩到极短时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gsap.globalTimeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 或者禁用特定类型的动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // ScrollTrigger 保留（位置触发不涉及运动），但动画时长压缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"无障碍动画检查清单\">无障碍动画检查清单</h2><p>在发布前对动画功能进行检查：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[动画无障碍检查] --&gt; B{&quot;有 prefers-reduced-motion&lt;br/&gt;适配吗?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[添加 @media reduce 规则]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{&quot;是否有持续时间 &gt;5s&lt;br/&gt;的自动动画?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[添加暂停/停止控件]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{&quot;闪烁频率是否 &gt;3Hz?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[移除或降频,低于 3Hz]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H{&quot;视差效果是否有降级?&quot;}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[添加视差降级方案]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[通过检查]\">graph TD\n    A[动画无障碍检查] --&gt; B{\"有 prefers-reduced-motion&lt;br/&gt;适配吗?\"}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[添加 @media reduce 规则]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{\"是否有持续时间 &gt;5s&lt;br/&gt;的自动动画?\"}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[添加暂停/停止控件]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{\"闪烁频率是否 &gt;3Hz?\"}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[移除或降频,低于 3Hz]\n    F --&gt;|否| H{\"视差效果是否有降级?\"}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[添加视差降级方案]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[通过检查]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>prefers-reduced-motion</strong>：CSS 媒体查询，反映用户在操作系统「减少动效」设置；<code>reduce</code> 表示用户偏好减少动画</li>\n<li><strong>前庭障碍（vestibular disorders）</strong>：影响空间定向和平衡感的内耳疾病；视差滚动、大范围平移等动画可引发眩晕</li>\n<li><strong>WCAG 2.2.2</strong>：要求持续时间超过 5 秒的自动动画提供暂停/停止/隐藏控件</li>\n<li><strong><code>0.01ms</code> 而非 <code>0ms</code></strong>：将时长设为 <code>0.01ms</code> 而非 <code>0</code> 是为了确保 <code>animationend</code> 事件正常触发，防止依赖此事件的逻辑失效</li>\n<li><strong><code>update: slow</code></strong>：CSS 媒体查询，针对低刷新率设备（如 e-ink 屏幕）；通常与 <code>prefers-reduced-motion: reduce</code> 组合使用</li>\n<li><strong>光敏性癫痫阈值</strong>：闪烁频率 &gt;3Hz 可能触发光敏性癫痫发作，WCAG 2.3.1 要求不超过此频率</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><code>prefers-reduced-motion: reduce</code> 是无障碍动画的最低合规要求——为所有动画添加媒体查询适配，或全局设置 <code>transition-duration: 0.01ms</code>。对视差滚动、大范围平移等高危动画，需提供安全替代方案（仅 opacity 渐变）。自动循环动画超过 5 秒需提供暂停控件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章导航\">本章导航</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"orchestration-stagger\">编排与交错</a> — stagger 算法与时序管理</li>\n<li>章节概览：<a href=\"../performance/\">性能与模式</a></li>\n<li>Hub 概览：<a href=\"./\">Web 动画工程</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无障碍与动效偏好：prefers-reduced-motion 与前庭障碍保护","id":"无障碍与动效偏好-prefers-reduced-motion-与前庭障碍保护"},{"level":2,"text":"前庭障碍与动画危险性","id":"前庭障碍与动画危险性"},{"level":2,"text":"prefers-reduced-motion 媒体查询","id":"prefers-reduced-motion-媒体查询"},{"level":3,"text":"全局重置策略","id":"全局重置策略"},{"level":2,"text":"JavaScript 中检测 reduced-motion","id":"javascript-中检测-reduced-motion"},{"level":3,"text":"React Hook 封装","id":"react-hook-封装"},{"level":2,"text":"动画时长上限规范","id":"动画时长上限规范"},{"level":2,"text":"动画开关：用户控制界面","id":"动画开关-用户控制界面"},{"level":2,"text":"GSAP 中的全局动效偏好处理","id":"gsap-中的全局动效偏好处理"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍动画检查清单","id":"无障碍动画检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章导航","id":"本章导航"}],"prev":{"title":"编排与交错：时间轴设计、stagger 算法与 delay 计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/performance/orchestration-stagger"},"next":null}